Package: simling
Title: Simulated Linguistic Data for Teaching Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Simulated data sets from linguistics for teaching statistics in
    R: reaction times, vowel durations, formants, accuracy, formant and pupil
    trajectories, and sociolinguistic variation. Each data set comes with the
    code that generated it, so the true effects are known.
